day but couldn't.  Isn't that always the way things happen? So, I'm getting some grocery shopping done and running some errands.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Don't you feel that you're overdoing it, though? Your cart seems awfully full.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The office is going to shift the meetings to the end of next week. I'm going to have all this eaten by then. I wanted to get the organic stuff. The chemicals and pesticides they use on most produce can cause health problems.", "id": 1, "time": "000", "image": "engenn9le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I agree. Unfortunately you pay a lot more for it. Many people have to choose cheaper unhealthier options.  Don't you agree that puts the customer in a difficult position?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I know it does. I'm spending extra to get healthier food. I'd rather have the money.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, isn't that more important than money?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I guess. Where are you off to next?", "id": 2, "time": "38500", "image": "engenn9le07ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I broke a heel yesterday, so I have to go to the shoemaker to get it fixed. There's one nearby.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I was going to get my jacket cleaned. I spilled something on it today and I need to take it with me next week.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Let's check out, and get those things done. You can make me dinner.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Are you sure?", "id": 3, "time": "61000", "image": "engenn9le07ob03re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le07ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le07ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}